      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-10-20T22:15:32.259Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Underworlds episode was November 2021, the followup of actually creating the “linked babies” was in April 2022. So the exact backdate hinges on how premeditated you think the linked babies idea was in the first ep.</p>\n<p>For Alpha, the Creative Process: Werewolf Stories episode we first heard about her was May 2021 and the RCR KS was March 2022.</p>\n<p>So based on that… if it’s <em>not</em> Fashion I’d expect to hear about some hero we haven’t known about before hinted at a year or two before we expect the new box they’ll be in.</p>",
