      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f1d935/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-10-21T04:41:41.074Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am pretty sure that I remember in one of the interviews about definitive edition before the Kickstarter, that Christopher and Paul answered a question from someone saying that they would love to see Young Legacy get ser own deck, so they could play Legacy’s with their daughter. I cannot remember which one let it slip, but it was not refuted.</p>\n<p>I watched everything back then, because I was originally against the idea of definitive edition. And I wanted to see why I should care. And I am glad I did.</p>",
