      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-02-02T17:36:24.731Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That might well be a big part of the reason why they dragged their heels for so long on the book that it likely has completely unhappened.  Once they finalized that encyclopedic summary of the entire metaverse, they would kinda be done, and it’d be hard to generate hype or maintain mystery or otherwise build anticipation.  When writing a single story becomes your whole deal, you’re going to have a hard time ever setting down “The. End.”  (See also the sixth and seventh Game of Thrones novels.)</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
